  "reasoning": "The defendant operated a breakfast shop and mistakenly used a toxic substance (nitrite) as sugar, leading to 13 customers being poisoned and one death. This constitutes the illegal production and sale of a harmful food product, which under Chinese criminal law is charged as '生产、销售有毒、有害食品'. The conduct is not intentional homicide but a food safety violation resulting in death.",
